{"name":"Sleepy Hollow","hex":"#839c6d","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Sleepy Hollow","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A census-designated place in Marin County, California, United States.","A village in the town of Mount Pleasant, Westchester County, New York, United States."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any very quiet and uneventful locality."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Sleepy_Hollow"}],"entries":[{"title":"The Legend of Sleepy Hollow (1980 film)","blocks":[{"text":"The Legend of Sleepy Hollow is a 1980 American made-for-television film produced by Sunn Classic Pictures as a part of their Classics Illustrated series. It was filmed partly in Park City, Utah, and shown on NBC. It starred Jeff Goldblum as Ichabod Crane, Meg Foster as Katrina von Tassel, and Dick Butkus as Brom Bones. It was directed by Henning Schellerup and produced by Charles Sellier, who was nominated for an Emmy Award for his work on the movie."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/5a/The_Legend_of_Sleepy_Hollow_%281980%29_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Legend_of_Sleepy_Hollow_(1980_film)","wikidata":"Q10381545"},{"title":"Sleepy Hollow (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Sleepy Hollow is a 1999 Gothic horror film directed by Tim Burton from a screenplay by Andrew Kevin Walker. Co-produced by Paramount Pictures, Mandalay Pictures, Scott Rudin Productions, American Zoetrope, and Tim Burton Productions, it is based on Washington Irving's 1820 short story \"The Legend of Sleepy Hollow\", and stars Johnny Depp and Christina Ricci, with Miranda Richardson, Michael Gambon, Casper Van Dien, and Jeffrey Jones in supporting roles. The plot follows New York City police constable Ichabod Crane (Depp), who is sent to investigate a series of brutal murders in the upstate village of Sleepy Hollow, where he becomes romantically involved with Katrina Van Tassel (Ricci), the daughter of the richest resident of the town (Gambon)."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/09/Sleepy_hollow_ver2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sleepy_Hollow_(film)","wikidata":"Q208592"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Johnny_Depp_%28July_2009%29_2.jpg/330px-Johnny_Depp_%28July_2009%29_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Johnny_Depp_%28July_2009%29_2.jpg/330px-Johnny_Depp_%28July_2009%29_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJohnny_Depp_(July_2009)_2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Christina_Ricci_by_David_Shankbone.jpg/500px-Christina_Ricci_by_David_Shankbone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Christina_Ricci_by_David_Shankbone.jpg/1280px-Christina_Ricci_by_David_Shankbone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Christina_Ricci_by_David_Shankbone.jpg/500px-Christina_Ricci_by_David_Shankbone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AChristina_Ricci_by_David_Shankbone.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Miranda_Richardson_Met_Opera_2010_Shankbone.jpg/500px-Miranda_Richardson_Met_Opera_2010_Shankbone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Miranda_Richardson_Met_Opera_2010_Shankbone.jpg/1280px-Miranda_Richardson_Met_Opera_2